# Section B: API Endpoint Plan

| HTTP Method | Route                         | Description                                                  | Role Required         | Request Body                                                                       | Expected Response                              |
| ----------- | ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| POST        | `/api/auth/register`          | Registers a new RaceDay user.                                | Public                | FirstName, LastName, Email, Password, Role, PhoneNumber                            | `201 Created` – User registered successfully   |
| POST        | `/api/auth/login`             | Authenticates a user using their login credentials.          | Public                | Email, Password                                                                    | `200 OK` – Login successful                    |
| GET         | `/api/users/profile`          | Retrieves the profile of the currently logged-in user.       | Authenticated User    | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – User profile                        |
| PUT         | `/api/users/profile`          | Updates the profile of the currently logged-in user.         | Authenticated User    | FirstName, LastName, PhoneNumber                                                   | `200 OK` – Profile updated                     |
| GET         | `/api/events`                 | Retrieves all available RaceDay events.                      | Public                | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – List of events                      |
| GET         | `/api/events/{id}`            | Retrieves details of a specific event.                       | Public                | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – Event details                       |
| POST        | `/api/events`                 | Creates a new running, walking or cycling event.             | Organiser             | EventName, Description, EventDate, Location, RegistrationDeadline, Status          | `201 Created` – Event created                  |
| PUT         | `/api/events/{id}`            | Updates an existing event.                                   | Organiser             | EventName, Description, EventDate, Location, RegistrationDeadline, Status          | `200 OK` – Event updated                       |
| DELETE      | `/api/events/{id}`            | Removes an existing event.                                   | Organiser             | None                                                                               | `204 No Content` – Event deleted               |
| GET         | `/api/events/{id}/categories` | Retrieves all categories belonging to an event.              | Public                | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – List of categories                  |
| GET         | `/api/categories/{id}`        | Retrieves details of a specific event category.              | Public                | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – Category details                    |
| POST        | `/api/categories`             | Creates a new category for an event.                         | Organiser             | EventID, CategoryName, DistanceKM, EntryFee, AgeGroup, Description                 | `201 Created` – Category created               |
| PUT         | `/api/categories/{id}`        | Updates an existing event category.                          | Organiser             | CategoryName, DistanceKM, EntryFee, AgeGroup, Description                          | `200 OK` – Category updated                    |
| DELETE      | `/api/categories/{id}`        | Deletes an event category.                                   | Organiser             | None                                                                               | `204 No Content` – Category deleted            |
| POST        | `/api/enrolments`             | Registers a participant for an event category.               | Participant           | EventID, CategoryID                                                                | `201 Created` – Enrolment created              |
| GET         | `/api/enrolments`             | Retrieves enrolments belonging to the logged-in participant. | Participant           | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – List of enrolments                  |
| GET         | `/api/enrolments/{id}`        | Retrieves details of a specific enrolment.                   | Participant/Organiser | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – Enrolment details                   |
| PUT         | `/api/enrolments/{id}`        | Updates an existing enrolment.                               | Participant/Organiser | EventID, CategoryID, PaymentStatus                                                 | `200 OK` – Enrolment updated                   |
| DELETE      | `/api/enrolments/{id}`        | Cancels a participant's enrolment.                           | Participant/Organiser | None                                                                               | `204 No Content` – Enrolment cancelled         |
| GET         | `/api/events/{id}/enrolments` | Retrieves all participants enrolled in an event.             | Organiser             | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – List of participants                |
| POST        | `/api/results`                | Records a participant's result for an event.                 | Organiser             | EnrolmentID, FinishTime, ChipTime, PositionOverall, PositionCategory, Pace, Status | `201 Created` – Result recorded                |
| GET         | `/api/results`                | Retrieves available race results.                            | Authenticated User    | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – List of results                     |
| GET         | `/api/results/{id}`           | Retrieves a specific race result.                            | Authenticated User    | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – Result details                      |
| PUT         | `/api/results/{id}`           | Updates a participant's race result.                         | Organiser             | FinishTime, ChipTime, PositionOverall, PositionCategory, Pace, Status              | `200 OK` – Result updated                      |
| DELETE      | `/api/results/{id}`           | Deletes a race result.                                       | Organiser             | None                                                                               | `204 No Content` – Result deleted              |
| GET         | `/api/events/{id}/results`    | Retrieves all results for a specific event.                  | Authenticated User    | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – Event results                       |
| GET         | `/api/routes`                 | Retrieves available event routes.                            | Public                | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – List of routes                      |
| GET         | `/api/events/{id}/routes`     | Retrieves routes associated with an event.                   | Public                | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – List of routes                      |
| POST        | `/api/routes`                 | Creates a route for an event.                                | Organiser             | EventID, RouteName, DistanceKM, Description, MapURL                                | `201 Created` – Route created                  |
| PUT         | `/api/routes/{id}`            | Updates an existing event route.                             | Organiser             | RouteName, DistanceKM, Description, MapURL                                         | `200 OK` – Route updated                       |
| DELETE      | `/api/routes/{id}`            | Deletes an event route.                                      | Organiser             | None                                                                               | `204 No Content` – Route deleted               |
| GET         | `/api/weather`                | Retrieves available weather information.                     | Public                | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – Weather information                 |
| GET         | `/api/events/{id}/weather`    | Retrieves weather information for a specific event.          | Public                | None                                                                               | `200 OK` – Event weather information           |
| POST        | `/api/weather`                | Adds weather information for an event.                       | Organiser             | EventID, RecordedAt, Temperature, Humidity, WindSpeed, WeatherCondition            | `201 Created` – Weather information added      |
| PUT         | `/api/weather/{id}`           | Updates weather information for an event.                    | Organiser             | RecordedAt, Temperature, Humidity, WindSpeed, WeatherCondition                     | `200 OK` – Weather information updated         |
| DELETE      | `/api/weather/{id}`           | Deletes weather information.                                 | Organiser             | None                                                                               | `204 No Content` – Weather information deleted |
